1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,432
Speaking, task three. Story number 2: A trip to the mountains. What did Petr and Jana do on Saturday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:12,879
What did Petr and Jana do on Saturday?

3
00:00:33,567 --> 00:00:36,133
On Saturday Petr and Jana went on a trip to the mountains.

4
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:38,854
In the morning they sat on the train and looked out of the window.

5
00:00:39,067 --> 00:00:41,284
It was nice outside and the sun was shining.

6
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,992
Then they walked up the path to the top of the hill.

7
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,100
The way was long, but the nature was beautiful.

8
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,900
Suddenly it started to rain.

9
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:52,467
Petr and Jana had no umbrella, so they got completely wet.

10
00:00:52,667 --> 00:00:54,325
Finally they found a small hut.

11
00:00:54,533 --> 00:00:56,733
They sat down at the table and drank hot tea.

12
00:00:56,933 --> 00:00:59,533
They rested and waited for the rain to stop.

13
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:08,513
Tell story 2 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
